ents","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[P2] Give null results a consistent ordering.\n\nWhen `order` ties, a null `item` bypasses the Scene Tree tie-break and is equivalent to every tied result. Two non-null nodes may still compare differently via `is_greater_than()`, so equivalence is not transitive and this comparator does not meet `std::sort`'s strict weak ordering requirement. The 3D picker can append results with null `item` values and sorts them afterward. Filter null results before sorting or place them consistently in the ordering, and add a regression case for mixed null/non-null equal-order entries.","created_at":"2026-10-05T16:45:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T16:50:06Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124153#discussion_r4186469323","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124153","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4186469323"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124153#discussion_r4186469323"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124153"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4186469323/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":55,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":13,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4187779960","pull_request_review_id":5419395270,"id":4187779960,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc75nHN4","diff_hunk":"@@ -50,6 +51,22 @@ bool DebuggerHelpers::is_shortcut_pressed(const int p_idx, const HashMap<int, Re\n \treturn false;\n }\n \n+bool DebuggerHelpers::SelectResult::operator<(const SelectResult &p_rr) const {\n+\tif (order == p_rr.order ) {\n+\n+ \t\tif (it